{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"FONT SET 16,16,\u0022C64 PRO MONO\u0022\nPAPER 6\nINKG 14\nPRINTG AT 5,0,\u0022**** COMMODORE 64 BASIC V2 ****\u0022\nPRINTG AT 1,1,\u002264K RAM SYSTEM  38911 BASIC BYTES FREE\u0022\nPRINTG AT 0,3,\u0022READY\u0022\nPRINTG\n\nINKG 0 : PRINTG \u0022Black\u0022\nINKG 1 : PRINTG \u0022White\u0022\nINKG 2 : PRINTG \u0022Red\u0022\nINKG 3 : PRINTG \u0022Cyan\u0022\nINKG 4 : PRINTG \u0022Purple\u0022\nINKG 5 : PRINTG \u0022Green\u0022\nINKG 6 : PRINTG \u0022Blue\u0022\nINKG 7 : PRINTG \u0022Yellow\u0022\nINKG 8 : PRINTG \u0022Orange\u0022\nINKG 9 : PRINTG \u0022Brown\u0022\nINKG 10 : PRINTG \u0022Light Red\u0022\nINKG 11 : PRINTG \u0022Dark Grey\u0022\nINKG 12 : PRINTG \u0022Grey\u0022\nINKG 13 : PRINTG \u0022Light Green\u0022\nINKG 14 : PRINTG \u0022Light Blue\u0022\n\nPRINTG\n\nINKG White\nFOR I = 0 TO 255\n    PRINTG CHR$(I),\n    IF I = 40 OR I = 80 OR I = 120 OR I = 160 OR I = 200 OR I = 240 THEN \n      PRINTG\n    ENDIF\nNEXT I","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}